      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "In a moderate maiden INTENSE DREAM (6) gets her chance on debut. By Bivouac from an imported mare. Has trialled three times and won them all, the two most recent in very convincing style. Looks good enough to take care of this field. THORSTEN (2) settled handy then battled on well albeit beaten comfortably into third when resuming over 1000m at Kembla last start. Lightly raced four-year-old who should benefit greatly from that hit-out. Ciaron Maher-trained filly WILD COURAGE (9) is back from a 19-week spell. Opened the maiden campaign with a placing over this course and distance, coming from last in a small field. Two recent trials should have her up to the mark. LADY TALEA (7) has raced here at 900m three times for three placings. Must come into calculations.",
